[node name="KBM" type="Label" parent="Text/Settings" unique_id=429999757]
offset_left = 4998.0
offset_right = 7176.0
offset_bottom = 637.0
text = "Controls:

KBM:
Camera: Move with mouse
Move: WASD, Arrow Keys
Jump: Space
Sprint: Shift
Super Sprint: Shift + Ctrl

Duplicate object: 1
Delete object: 0
Pick up object: E, Left Mouse Click
Put down object: Q, Right Mouse Click
Scale object: Scroll wheel, up+down
Enter Supermenu: ESC

Nothing else to say :)"
label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_mae5d")

